Description: Estimates daily contribution-weighted information shares (CWIS)
    for futures and spot markets with partially overlapping trading hours.
    The package estimates Hasbrouck information shares during overlapping
    sessions, estimates realized variation during single-market sessions,
    and aggregates period-specific contributions into daily CWIS values.
    The methodology is based on Dimpfl and Schweikert (2023)
    <doi:10.1016/j.jbankfin.2023.106970>.
